
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Blocking Requests Rejected         	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Received/sec                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Total/sec                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Bytes Transmitted/sec              	N/A                 	N/A       
Caption                            	N/A                 	N/A       
Context Blocks Queued/sec          	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Access Permissions          	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Granted Access              	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors Logon                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Errors System                      	N/A                 	N/A       
File Directory Searches            	N/A                 	N/A       
Files Open                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Files Opened Total                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_Object                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_PerfTime                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Frequency_Sys100NS                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Logon Total                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Logon/sec                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Bytes                	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Failures             	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Nonpaged Peak                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Bytes                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Failures                	N/A                 	N/A       
Pool Paged Peak                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Server Sessions                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Errored Out               	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Forced Off                	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Logged Off                	N/A                 	N/A       
Sessions Timed Out                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_Object                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_PerfTime                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Timestamp_Sys100NS                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Work Item Shortages                	N/A                 	N/A       

